cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Trustworthy Deep Learning System for Chest X-ray Pneumonia Detection using Explainable AI
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "Research Team"
    affiliation: "Trustworthy Deep Learning Research Project"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-org/chest-xray-trustworthy-dl"
keywords:
  - chest x-ray
  - pneumonia detection
  - explainable AI
  - Grad-CAM
  - temperature scaling
  - trustworthy AI
  - deep learning
abstract: >
  A calibrated and explainable deep learning framework for binary chest X-ray
  classification (Normal vs Pneumonia) combining CNN classifiers, post-hoc
  temperature scaling, Grad-CAM explainability, Monte Carlo Dropout uncertainty
  estimation, and trust-aware analysis for clinical decision support research.
